      "description": "Block-wide nav; current tab is a turmeric fill, badges in madder, buti strip at the foot.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-b ds-bar\"><div class=\"ds-tabs\"><span class=\"ds-brand\">SuPar <span>Home</span></span><span class=\"ds-tab cur\">Home</span><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#\">Lights<span class=\"ds-count\">3</span></a><a class=\"ds-tab\" href=\"#\">Security</a></div><div class=\"ds-buti\"></div></nav>",
